# Task 3: Syntax-class validation — @VarRef annotation rejects non-VarRef args.
# [macro pragma [let name@VarRef value@Literal] ...] validates arg types before expansion.
# Passing a literal string "optimize" where VarRef is expected should fail validation.
[macro pragma [let name@VarRef value@Literal]
  [quote [str [unquote name] "=" [unquote value]]]]

[pragma "optimize" true]
=== error
[E012] macro expansion error: macro 'pragma': argument 'name' expected VarRef, got Literal (defined at 6:1-6:25)
